{"title":"LE","slug":"LE","html":"<div class=\"wk-note wk-stub\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-note-label\">Stub</span></p>\n<p>This page on the OSDev Wiki is a stub: it covers the basics but is not complete.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox\">\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-title\">\n<p><a data-wiki=\"Executable Formats\" href=\"#/library/Executable_Formats\">Executable Formats</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\">Microsoft</span> <strong>16 bit:</strong> · <a data-wiki=\"COM\" href=\"#/library/COM\">COM</a> · <a data-wiki=\"MZ\" href=\"#/library/MZ\">MZ</a> · <a data-wiki=\"NE\" href=\"#/library/NE\">NE</a> · <strong>Mixed (16/32 bit):</strong> · <a data-wiki=\"LE\" href=\"#/library/LE\">LE</a> · <strong>32/64 bit:</strong> · <a data-wiki=\"PE\" href=\"#/library/PE\">PE</a> · <a data-wiki=\"COFF\" href=\"#/library/COFF\">COFF</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\">*nix</span> <a data-wiki=\"A.out\" href=\"#/library/A_out\">a.out</a> · <a data-wiki=\"ELF\" href=\"#/library/ELF\">ELF</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wk-navbox-row\">\n<p><span class=\"wk-navbox-group\">Apple</span> <a data-wiki=\"Mach-O\" href=\"#/library/Mach_O\">Mach-O</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The \"LE\" Linear Executable format was designed for IBM's OS/2 operating system by Microsoft. It supports both 16 and 32bit segments.</p>\n<p>Operating Systems that use it: OS/2, Watcom Compiler/Extender (DOS), Windows 3.x and 9x VxDs</p>\n<h2 id=\"see_also\">See Also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"ext\" href=\"http://hobbes.nmsu.edu/download/pub/os2/dev/info/lxexe.doc\" rel=\"noopener\">Specification</a> (Direct File Link)</li>\n</ul>\n","toc":[{"id":"see_also","text":"See Also","level":2}],"categories":["Executable Formats"],"rating":null,"flags":["stub"],"words":89,"summary":"The \"LE\" Linear Executable format was designed for IBM's OS/2 operating system by Microsoft. It supports both 16 and 32bit segments.","updated":"2020-11-21","authors":["Nexos"],"url":"https://wiki.osdev.org/LE","history":"https://wiki.osdev.org/index.php?title=LE&action=history","backlinks":[{"t":"A.out","s":"A_out"},{"t":"COM","s":"COM"},{"t":"DWARF","s":"DWARF"},{"t":"ELF","s":"ELF"},{"t":"ELF Tutorial","s":"ELF_Tutorial"},{"t":"MZ","s":"MZ"},{"t":"Mach-O","s":"Mach_O"},{"t":"NE","s":"NE"},{"t":"PE","s":"PE"}],"lessons":[]}